              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Musayipitse dziko limene mukukhalamolo. Magazi amayipitsa dziko ndipo nʼkosatheka kulipirira dziko chifukwa cha magazi amene akhetsedwa mʼmenemo, kupatula pokhetsa magazi a munthu amene anakhetsa magaziyo.",
          "type": "text",
